{"t": 1787306964.605, "kind": "message", "args": {"text": "Both pass: 5/5 tests OK, security scan clean.\n\nThe fix in `linkcheck/check.py:11-12` adds an early return for anchor-only (`#section`) and query-only (`?key=val`) URLs, classifying them as **not broken** before the empty-host check runs. The old logic (`and \"#\" not in url`) handled this by accident; the new code makes the intent explicit."}, "raw_ref": 29}
